# Load the last Black Omen save point, walk to Queen Zeal and win the first Queen Zeal battle with Crono,
# Marle and Lucca: Luminaire, Antipode 3, Lightning 2, Life, Ice 2, Spincut, Confuse, Delta Force, Ice Sword 2,
# Flare, heals and a revive-all item, against Zeal's Hallation (HP to 1); victory with a MegaElixir drop.
# Then the Mammon Machine battle: MegaElixir, Ice Sword 2, Mega Bomb, Delta Force, Luminaire, Antipode 3, Confuse,
# Haste, a plain attack, FireSword 2, Ice 2, Lightning 2 and Flare against its energy shifts (Magic becomes attack
# pwr), Point Flare and stored-energy release; victory, Zeal's dialogue, and the start of the Zeal (face and hands) battle.
# Save: ctsave15-black_omen slot 3 (fantasyanime.com/squaresoft/ctsaves-srm.htm, chrono_trigger.srm).
